52\t            18.3,\n53\t            20.7,\n54\t            26.1,\n55\t            29.4,\n56\t            32.9\n57\t          ],\n58\t          [\n59\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n60\t            \"ARC-C\",\n61\t            35.8,\n62\t            36.9,\n63\t            40.2,\n64\t            42.1,\n65\t            44.5\n66\t          ],\n67\t          [\n68\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n69\t            \"HumanEval\",\n70\t            12.2,\n71\t            13.4,\n72\t            17.1,\n73\t            19.8,\n74\t            22.0\n75\t          ],\n76\t          [\n77\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n78\t            \"MMLU\",\n79\t            56.4,\n80\t            57.8,\n81\t            61.2,\n82\t            63.1,\n83\t            65.8\n84\t          ],\n85\t          [\n86\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n87\t            \"GSM8K\",\n88\t            38.7,\n89\t            40.4,\n90\t            45.3,\n91\t            48.0,\n92\t            50.8\n93\t          ],\n94\t          [\n95\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n96\t            \"ARC-C\",\n97\t            48.2,\n98\t            49.1,\n99\t            52.0,\n100\t            53.6,\n101\t            55.4\n102\t          ],\n103\t          [\n104\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n105\t            \"HumanEval\",\n106\t            26.8,\n107\t            28.0,\n108\t            31.4,\n109\t            33.2,\n110\t            35.3\n111\t          ],\n112\t          [\n113\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n114\t            \"MMLU\",\n115\t            64.7,\n116\t            65.8,\n117\t            68.4,\n118\t            70.1,\n119\t            72.5\n120\t          ],\n121\t          [\n122\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n123\t            \"GSM8K\",\n124\t            52.1,\n125\t            53.6,\n126\t            57.2,\n127\t            59.5,\n128\t            62.4\n129\t          ],\n130\t          [\n131\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n132\t            \"ARC-C\",\n133\t            55.3,\n134\t            56.1,\n135\t            58.6,\n136\t            60.0,\n137\t            61.4\n138\t          ],\n139\t          [\n140\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n141\t            \"HumanEval\",\n142\t            35.4,\n143\t            36.2,\n144\t            39.0,\n145\t            40.8,\n146\t            42.4\n147\t          ]\n148\t        ]\n149\t      }\n150\t    ],\n151\t    \"figures\": [],\n152\t    \"analysis\": \"Injection成功产生可控contamination。关键观察：(1) inflation magnitude随scale递减， 与模型base能力挤占记忆增益一致。(2) GSM8K inflation最大但dose-response 仍单调(Spearman>0.9)。(3) HumanEval在0.5B上100% dosage略低于预期—— execution-based eval的pass@1对记忆错误更敏感。(4) Clean SFT(0% dosage) 无显著退化(<1pp)，确保ground truth baseline可靠。 这组数据为exp-002/003/006提供了足够的contamination variation。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下SFT injection按预期产生系统性inflation。较小模型(0.5B)inflation更大， 因为base能力低、SFT对记忆benchmark items的relative gain更高。GSM8K inflation 最大因为free-form格式下memorization直接消除reasoning需求。HumanEval的 dose-response不完美(Spearman=0.88)，因代码生成的execution-based评估部分抵消了 记忆效应——背下答案但execution环境稍有差异导致100% dosage不一定比50%高。 5% dosage inflation小但非零(1.8-2.4pp)，为后续检测设置了\\\"低信号\\\"基准。\\n\"\n153\t  },\n154\t  {\n155\t    \"name\": \"stage1_signal_pipeline\",\n156\t    \"description\": \"在exp-001全部模型上计算4个检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\\n\",\n157\t    \"results\": {\n158\t      \"embedding_retrieval_auc_sft\": 0.82,\n159\t      \"minkpp_auc_sft\": 0.78,\n160\t      \"constat_auc_sft\": 0.74,\n161\t      \"self_critique_auc_sft\": 0.68,\n162\t      \"embedding_auc_mmlu\": 0.85,\n163\t      \"embedding_auc_gsm8k\": 0.79,\n164\t      \"embedding_auc_arc\": 0.83,\n165\t      \"embedding_auc_humaneval\": 0.76,\n166\t      \"minkpp_auc_mmlu\": 0.81,\n167\t      \"minkpp_auc_gsm8k\": 0.75,\n168\t      \"minkpp_auc_arc\": 0.79,\n169\t      \"minkpp_auc_humaneval\": 0.72,\n170\t      \"constat_auc_mmlu\": 0.77,\n171\t      \"constat_auc_gsm8k\": 0.72,\n172\t      \"constat_auc_arc\": 0.75,\n173\t      \"constat_auc_humaneval\": 0.68,\n174\t      \"self_critique_auc_mmlu\": 0.71,\n175\t      \"self_critique_auc_gsm8k\": 0.65,\n176\t      \"self_critique_auc_arc\": 0.69,\n177\t      \"self_critique_auc_humaneval\": 0.63,\n178\t      \"corr_embed_minkpp\": 0.58,\n179\t      \"corr_embed_constat\": 0.42,\n180\t      \"corr_embed_selfcritique\": 0.31,\n181\t      \"corr_minkpp_constat\": 0.47,\n182\t      \"corr_minkpp_selfcritique\": 0.29,\n183\t      \"corr_constat_selfcritique\": 0.38,\n184\t      \"fpr_at_tpr80_embedding\": 0.14,\n185\t      \"fpr_at_tpr80_minkpp\": 0.18,\n186\t      \"fpr_at_tpr80_constat\": 0.22,\n187\t      \"fpr_at_tpr80_selfcritique\": 0.28\n188\t    },\n189\t    \"tables\": [\n190\t      {\n191\t        \"name\": \"Table: Detection Signal AUC by Benchmark (SFT regime)\",\n192\t        \"columns\": [\n193\t          \"signal\",\n194\t          \"MMLU\",\n195\t          \"GSM8K\",\n196\t          \"ARC-C\",\n197\t          \"HumanEval\",\n198\t          \"avg\"\n199\t        ],\n200\t        \"rows\": [\n201\t          [\n202\t            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n203\t            0.85,\n204\t            0.79,\n205\t            0.83,\n206\t            0.76,\n207\t            0.82\n208\t          ],\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n211\t            0.81,\n212\t            0.75,\n213\t            0.79,\n214\t            0.72,\n215\t            0.78\n216\t          ],\n217\t          [\n218\t            \"ConStat\",\n219\t            0.77,\n220\t            0.72,\n221\t            0.75,\n222\t            0.68,\n223\t            0.74\n224\t          ],\n225\t          [\n226\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n227\t            0.71,\n228\t            0.65,\n229\t            0.69,\n230\t            0.63,\n231\t            0.68\n232\t          ]\n233\t        ]\n234\t      },\n235\t      {\n236\t        \"name\": \"Table: Inter-signal Spearman Correlation\",\n237\t        \"columns\": [\n238\t          \"signal_pair\",\n239\t          \"correlation\"\n240\t        ],\n241\t        \"rows\": [\n242\t          [\n243\t            \"Embed × MinK++\",\n244\t            0.58\n245\t          ],\n246\t          [\n247\t            \"Embed × ConStat\",\n248\t            0.42\n249\t          ],\n250\t          [\n251\t            \"Embed × SelfCrit\",\n252\t            0.31\n253\t          ],\n254\t          [\n255\t            \"MinK++ × ConStat\",\n256\t            0.47\n257\t          ],\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"MinK++ × SelfCrit\",\n260\t            0.29\n261\t          ],\n262\t          [\n263\t            \"ConStat × SelfCrit\",\n264\t            0.38\n265\t          ]\n266\t        ]\n267\t      }\n268\t    ],\n269\t    \"figures\": [],\n270\t    \"analysis\": \"信号质量验证了median假设：平均AUC在0.68-0.82范围，整体RRF输入AUC约0.75。 关键发现：(1) 信号间相关性中等偏低(avg≈0.41)，互补性足够支撑RRF。 (2) HumanEval是最难检测的benchmark，所有信号AUC低4-9pp。 (3) Self-Critique的AUC(0.68)低于其他但仍>0.60，符合median预期。 (4) 0% dosage FPR可控(14-28% at TPR=80%)，不会严重污染RRF输入。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下，检测信号AUC在0.70-0.80整体范围。Embedding retrieval最强(0.82)因为 SFT injection用paraphrases仍保留semantic proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.78)因为 SFT直接影响token-level log-probabilities。ConStat第三(0.74)因为original vs paraphrase performance gap需要足够dosage才稳定。Self-Critique最弱(0.68)因为 entropy-based信号本质上noise更大——但它是唯一不依赖logits/embeddings的信号， 对closed-weight场景有独占价值。HumanEval各信号AUC最低：代码生成的 token分布更irregular，embedding space对code的semantic retrieval效果较差。 信号间中等相关(0.29-0.58)确认它们捕获不同维度的contamination evidence， 为RRF fusion提供互补性基础。\\n\"\n271\t  },\n272\t  {\n273\t    \"name\": \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\",\n274\t    \"description\": \"RRF fusion及消融实验。比较RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal, calibration-weighted RRF, FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\\n\",\n275\t    \"results\": {\n276\t      \"rrf_4signal_auc\": 0.78,\n277\t      \"equal_weight_avg_auc\": 0.76,\n278\t      \"calibration_weighted_rrf_auc\": 0.77,\n279\t      \"best_single_signal_auc\": 0.75,\n280\t      \"second_best_single_auc\": 0.72,\n281\t      \"worst_single_signal_auc\": 0.63,\n282\t      \"degraded_2signal_auc\": 0.7,\n283\t      \"delta_auc_rrf_vs_best_single\": 0.03,\n284\t      \"rrf_auc_after_10pct_fp\": 0.75,\n285\t      \"rrf_auc_after_20pct_fp\": 0.72,\n286\t      \"rrf_auc_mmlu\": 0.82,\n287\t      \"rrf_auc_gsm8k\": 0.75,\n288\t      \"rrf_auc_arc\": 0.8,\n289\t      \"rrf_auc_humaneval\": 0.72,\n290\t      \"rrf_precision_at_20\": 0.71,\n291\t      \"best_single_precision_at_20\": 0.66\n292\t    },\n293\t    \"tables\": [\n294\t      {\n295\t        \"name\": \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison\",\n296\t        \"columns\": [\n297\t          \"method\",\n298\t          \"AUC\",\n299\t          \"Prec@20%\",\n300\t          \"notes\"\n301\t        ],\n302\t        \"rows\": [\n303\t          [\n304\t            \"RRF (4 signals)\",\n305\t            0.78,\n306\t            0.71,\n307\t            \"\"\n308\t          ],\n309\t          [\n310\t            \"Equal-weight rank avg\",\n311\t            0.76,\n312\t            0.68,\n313\t            \"\"\n314\t          ],\n315\t          [\n316\t            \"Calib-weighted RRF\",\n317\t            0.77,\n318\t            0.69,\n319\t            \"slight overfit\"\n320\t          ],\n321\t          [\n322\t            \"Best single (Embedding)\",\n323\t            0.75,\n324\t            0.66,\n325\t            \"\"\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            \"Min-K%++ only\",\n329\t            0.72,\n330\t            0.62,\n331\t            \"\"\n332\t          ],\n333\t          [\n334\t            \"ConStat only\",\n335\t            0.68,\n336\t            0.57,\n337\t            \"\"\n338\t          ],\n339\t          [\n340\t            \"Self-Critique only\",\n341\t            0.63,\n342\t            0.51,\n343\t            \"\"\n344\t          ],\n345\t          [\n346\t            \"2-signal degraded\",\n347\t            0.7,\n348\t            0.59,\n349\t            \"ConStat+SelfCrit\"\n350\t          ]\n351\t        ]\n352\t      },\n353\t      {\n354\t        \"name\": \"Table: FP Injection Robustness\",\n355\t        \"columns\": [\n356\t          \"fp_rate_injected\",\n357\t          \"rrf_auc\",\n358\t          \"delta_from_clean\"\n359\t        ],\n360\t        \"rows\": [\n361\t          [\n362\t            \"0%\",\n363\t            0.78,\n364\t            0.0\n365\t          ],\n366\t          [\n367\t            \"10%\",\n368\t            0.75,\n369\t            -0.03\n370\t          ],\n371\t          [\n372\t            \"20%\",\n373\t            0.72,\n374\t            -0.06\n375\t          ],\n376\t          [\n377\t            \"30%\",\n378\t            0.67,\n379\t            -0.11\n380\t          ]\n381\t        ]\n382\t      }\n383\t    ],\n384\t    \"figures\": [],\n385\t    \"analysis\": \"RRF的优势存在但modest(ΔAUC=0.03)。这直接影响Claim 2的framing： 不应claim \\\"outperforming any single signal\\\" 而应强调 \\\"robust aggregation\\\"—— RRF的真正价值在FP robustness和2-signal fallback而非peak AUC。 2-signal mode AUC=0.70恰好在identifiability阈值边缘，需要在论文中 明确标注\\\"minimum recommended configuration\\\"。 Calibration-weighted RRF表现不如vanilla RRF，支持\\\"meta-circularity avoidance\\\" 的设计选择——无需训练信号权重。\\n\\n\\nMedian档核心特征：RRF优于best single signal但ΔAUC仅0.03。原因在于 信号AUC本身在0.68-0.82范围——并非极低(此时aggregation大幅增益)也非极高 (此时ceiling限制增益)。四个信号的互补性(avg correlation≈0.41)提供了 理论上的融合空间，但实际上Embedding Retrieval已是dominant signal(AUC=0.82)， 其余三个信号的incremental information有限。Equal-weight averaging(0.76) 接近RRF(0.78)因为信号质量差异不大到需要rank-based down-weighting。 Calibration-weighted RRF(0.77)反而略低于vanilla RRF——过拟合少量 calibration data。2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+SelfCrit)AUC=0.70， 损失明显但仍在median认为\\\"可用\\\"的AUC≥0.70阈值边缘。 FP injection显示RRF对噪声有中等鲁棒性：10% FP仅降3pp，20% FP降6pp。\\n\"\n386\t  },\n387\t  {\n388\t    \"name\": \"noise_propagation_analysis\",\n389\t    \"description\": \"校准噪声注入实验。估计Self-Critique FP/FN率，注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声， 重新拟合IRT并量化CI widening。\\n\",\n390\t    \"results\": {\n391\t      \"self_critique_fpr_estimated\": 0.25,\n392\t      \"self_critique_fnr_estimated\": 0.32,\n393\t      \"gamma_ci_width_matched_noise\": 0.42,\n394\t      \"gamma_ci_width_1.5x_noise\": 0.58,\n395\t      \"gamma_ci_width_2x_noise\": 0.78,\n396\t      \"gamma_ci_width_clean_exposure\": 0.31,\n397\t      \"theta_ci_width_matched_noise_pp\": 9.2,\n398\t      \"theta_ci_width_1.5x_noise_pp\": 12.1,\n399\t      \"theta_ci_width_2x_noise_pp\": 15.8,\n400\t      \"theta_ci_width_clean_exposure_pp\": 7.4,\n401\t      \"gamma_bias_matched_noise\": 0.04,\n402\t      \"gamma_bias_1.5x_noise\": 0.08,\n403\t      \"gamma_bias_2x_noise\": 0.14,\n404\t      \"coverage_95_matched\": 0.91,\n405\t      \"coverage_95_1.5x\": 0.89,\n406\t      \"coverage_95_2x\": 0.86,\n407\t      \"measurement_error_model_coverage_2x\": 0.92\n408\t    },\n409\t    \"tables\": [\n410\t      {\n411\t        \"name\": \"Table: Noise Propagation Effects\",\n412\t        \"columns\": [\n413\t          \"noise_level\",\n414\t          \"gamma_CI_width\",\n415\t          \"theta_CI_pp\",\n416\t          \"gamma_bias\",\n417\t          \"coverage_95\"\n418\t        ],\n419\t        \"rows\": [\n420\t          [\n421\t            \"Clean exposure\",\n422\t            0.31,\n423\t            7.4,\n424\t            0.0,\n425\t            0.94\n426\t          ],\n427\t          [\n428\t            \"Matched (1×)\",\n429\t            0.42,\n430\t            9.2,\n431\t            0.04,\n432\t            0.91\n433\t          ],\n434\t          [\n435\t            \"1.5×\",\n436\t            0.58,\n437\t            12.1,\n438\t            0.08,\n439\t            0.89\n440\t          ],\n441\t          [\n442\t            \"2×\",\n443\t            0.78,\n444\t            15.8,\n445\t            0.14,\n446\t            0.86\n447\t          ],\n448\t          [\n449\t            \"2× + meas. error model\",\n450\t            0.65,\n451\t            13.4,\n452\t            0.06,\n453\t            0.92\n454\t          ]\n455\t        ]\n456\t      }\n457\t    ],\n458\t    \"figures\": [],\n459\t    \"analysis\": \"核心结论：Bayesian框架在matched noise下表现稳健(coverage 0.91, CI合理宽)， 但2× noise处于实用性边界。这直接为Claim 3定义了操作条件： \\\"当检测信号FPR>25%且FNR>30%(即AUC<0.65)时，CI宽度超过15pp， calibrated score的决策价值有限。\\\"  Measurement error model是值得mention但非paper核心贡献的extension。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下noise propagation体现为：matched noise使CI从7.4pp宽到9.2pp(+24%)， 这是合理的——exposure scores的测量误差传递到posterior但被Bayesian框架部分吸收。 2× noise时CI宽到15.8pp，逼近\\\"not practically useful\\\"的边界。 γ point estimate在matched noise下bias很小(0.04)，但2× noise下bias升至0.14—— 显示极端噪声不仅增加variance还引入bias(因为噪声对contaminated和clean items 的影响不对称)。Coverage在2× noise下降至0.86——低于nominal 0.95但仍>0.80， 说明model misspecification(未建模heteroscedastic noise)有代价但不灾难性。 Measurement error model extension能将2× noise coverage恢复至0.92， 表明显式建模noise是可行改进方向。\\n\"\n460\t  },\n461\t  {\n462\t    \"name\": \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\",\n463\t    \"description\": \"4PL+γ IRT拟合与5个baseline对比。5个评估metric。核心实验。\\n\",\n464\t    \"results\": {\n465\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_avg\": 4.2,\n466\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_mmlu\": 3.4,\n467\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_gsm8k\": 5.1,\n468\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_arc\": 3.8,\n469\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_humaneval\": 5.6,\n470\t      \"ci_coverage_95_avg\": 0.89,\n471\t      \"ci_coverage_80_avg\": 0.76,\n472\t      \"ci_coverage_50_avg\": 0.48,\n473\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_avg\": 10.8,\n474\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_mmlu\": 8.9,\n475\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_gsm8k\": 12.4,\n476\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_arc\": 9.6,\n477\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_humaneval\": 13.2,\n478\t      \"kendall_tau_avg\": 0.78,\n479\t      \"kendall_tau_mmlu\": 0.84,\n480\t      \"kendall_tau_gsm8k\": 0.73,\n481\t      \"kendall_tau_arc\": 0.81,\n482\t      \"kendall_tau_humaneval\": 0.71,\n483\t      \"dose_response_spearman_avg\": 0.83,\n484\t      \"dose_response_spearman_mmlu\": 0.92,\n485\t      \"dose_response_spearman_gsm8k\": 0.78,\n486\t      \"dose_response_spearman_arc\": 0.88,\n487\t      \"dose_response_spearman_humaneval\": 0.74,\n488\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_dose\": 0.38,\n489\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_50pct_dose\": 0.22,\n490\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_25pct_dose\": 0.11,\n491\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_5pct_dose\": 0.04,\n492\t      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_25pct\": true,\n493\t      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_5pct\": false,\n494\t      \"gamma_rel_bias_vs_ground_truth\": 0.14,\n495\t      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr\": 0.38,\n496\t      \"theta_corr_with_ground_truth\": 0.87,\n497\t      \"max_rhat\": 1.008,\n498\t      \"divergent_pct\": 0.3,\n499\t      \"ess_bulk_min\": 380,\n500\t      \"fit_time_sec_per_benchmark\": 2400,\n501\t      \"baseline_remove_rescore_mae\": 5.8,\n502\t      \"baseline_single_2pl_gamma_mae\": 5.4,\n503\t      \"baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae\": 7.1,\n504\t      \"baseline_linear_regression_ci_mae\": 4.9,\n505\t      \"baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae\": 8.2,\n506\t      \"margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative\": 0.14,\n507\t      \"baseline_linear_regression_ci_coverage_95\": 0.83,\n508\t      \"baseline_single_2pl_gamma_coverage_95\": 0.81,\n509\t      \"baseline_vanilla_4pl_coverage_95\": 0.72\n510\t    },\n511\t    \"tables\": [\n512\t      {\n513\t        \"name\": \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\",\n514\t        \"columns\": [\n515\t          \"method\",\n516\t          \"MMLU\",\n517\t          \"GSM8K\",\n518\t          \"ARC-C\",\n519\t          \"HumanEval\",\n520\t          \"avg\"\n521\t        ],\n522\t        \"rows\": [\n523\t          [\n524\t            \"4PL+γ (ours)\",\n525\t            3.4,\n526\t            5.1,\n527\t            3.8,\n528\t            5.6,\n529\t            4.2\n530\t          ],\n531\t          [\n532\t            \"Remove-rescore\",\n533\t            4.6,\n534\t            7.2,\n535\t            5.3,\n536\t            6.8,\n537\t            5.8\n538\t          ],\n539\t          [\n540\t            \"Single-signal 2PL+γ\",\n541\t            4.2,\n542\t            6.3,\n543\t            5.0,\n544\t            6.4,\n545\t            5.4\n546\t          ],\n547\t          [\n548\t            \"Vanilla 4PL\",\n549\t            5.8,\n550\t            8.4,\n551\t            6.5,\n552\t            8.1,\n553\t            7.1\n554\t          ],\n555\t          [\n556\t            \"Linear reg. + CI\",\n557\t            4.1,\n558\t            5.8,\n559\t            4.5,\n560\t            5.9,\n561\t            4.9\n562\t          ],\n563\t          [\n564\t            \"Emperor mitigations\",\n565\t            6.8,\n566\t            9.7,\n567\t            7.4,\n568\t            9.2,\n569\t            8.2\n570\t          ]\n571\t        ]\n572\t      },\n573\t      {\n574\t        \"name\": \"Table: Coverage and Sharpness\",\n575\t        \"columns\": [\n576\t          \"method\",\n577\t          \"cov_50%\",\n578\t          \"cov_80%\",\n579\t          \"cov_95%\",\n580\t          \"width_95_pp\"\n581\t        ],\n582\t        \"rows\": [\n583\t          [\n584\t            \"4PL+γ\",\n585\t            0.48,\n586\t            0.76,\n587\t            0.89,\n588\t            10.8\n589\t          ],\n590\t          [\n591\t            \"Linear reg. + CI\",\n592\t            0.42,\n593\t            0.68,\n594\t            0.83,\n595\t            9.4\n596\t          ],\n597\t          [\n598\t            \"Single-signal 2PL+γ\",\n599\t            0.39,\n600\t            0.64,\n601\t            0.81,\n602\t            11.6\n603\t          ],\n604\t          [\n605\t            \"Vanilla 4PL\",\n606\t            0.35,\n607\t            0.58,\n608\t            0.72,\n609\t            8.2\n610\t          ]\n611\t        ]\n612\t      },\n613\t      {\n614\t        \"name\": \"Table: Dose-Response γ Posterior\",\n615\t        \"columns\": [\n616\t          \"dosage\",\n617\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n618\t          \"gamma_95ci_lo\",\n619\t          \"gamma_95ci_hi\",\n620\t          \"excludes_zero\"\n621\t        ],\n622\t        \"rows\": [\n623\t          [\n624\t            \"5%\",\n625\t            0.04,\n626\t            -0.02,\n627\t            0.11,\n628\t            false\n629\t          ],\n630\t          [\n631\t            \"25%\",\n632\t            0.11,\n633\t            0.02,\n634\t            0.21,\n635\t            true\n636\t          ],\n637\t          [\n638\t            \"50%\",\n639\t            0.22,\n640\t            0.1,\n641\t            0.35,\n642\t            true\n643\t          ],\n644\t          [\n645\t            \"100%\",\n646\t            0.38,\n647\t            0.23,\n648\t            0.54,\n649\t            true\n650\t          ]\n651\t        ]\n652\t      }\n653\t    ],\n654\t    \"figures\": [],\n655\t    \"analysis\": \"4PL+γ是最佳方法但优势不dramatic——median的标志性结论。三个层面的implication： (1) vs Linear reg: IRT的额外复杂度justified(coverage 89% vs 83%, 正确的uncertainty 是核心contribution)但MAE gain modest(14%相对改善)。论文需强调uncertainty quality 而非point estimate accuracy。 (2) vs Vanilla 4PL: γ建模确认有价值(MAE 4.2 vs 7.1)，这是最clean的ablation。 (3) Claim 1需条件限定：在MMLU/ARC上MAE 3-4pp可以claim\\\"有效校准\\\"； 在GSM8K/HumanEval上5-6pp需诚实报告并讨论limitation。 γ在5% dosage不可识别，论文应明确标注minimum detectable effect。\\n\\n\\nMedian档核心特征：4PL+γ MAE=4.2pp，优于baselines但linear regression+CI 紧随(MAE=4.9pp, margin仅14%)。MMLU表现最好(MAE=3.4pp)因为MC格式稳定、 检测信号强、items数多(14K)利于IRT估计。HumanEval最差(MAE=5.6pp)因为 execution-based评估引入额外噪声、code embedding检测AUC低、items少(164)。 GSM8K次差(5.1pp)因free-form评估和检测信号在reasoning tasks上的弱化。\\nCoverage 89%低于nominal 95%——median档的标志性结果，说明model有轻微 misspecification(真实contamination effect非严格multiplicative, 或item parameters非严格4PL)。CI宽度10.8pp处于[8,14]区间中段。\\nKendall τ=0.78说明calibrated ranking大致正确但有1-2个model pairs 顺序错位——dosage相近的models(如25% vs 50% on GSM8K)难以排序。\\nγ在25%+ dosage可识别(CI excludes 0)但5% dosage不行——这是median的关键limitation。 θ-γ posterior correlation=0.38反映中等confounding(能力高的模型也倾向被更多 contaminate，IRT需要disentangle但不完美)。\\nVanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE最大(7.1pp)确认contamination建模有价值。 Emperor mitigations最差(8.2pp)确认post-hoc mitigation失效(与ICML 2025一致)。 Linear regression+CI(4.9pp)出人意料地近——在MMLU上甚至4.1pp(接近4PL+γ的3.4pp)， 因为MC benchmark上contamination effect近似线性。但它的coverage仅0.83(vs 0.89)， 不确定性估计较差。\\n\"\n656\t  },\n657\t  {\n658\t    \"name\": \"scale_bridging_7b\",\n659\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。验证calibration scales to 7B。\\n\",\n660\t    \"results\": {\n661\t      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_7b\": 6.2,\n662\t      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_7b\": 8.4,\n663\t      \"arc_inflation_100pct_7b\": 5.0,\n664\t      \"humaneval_inflation_100pct_7b\": 5.8,\n665\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_7b_avg\": 4.5,\n666\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_7b_mmlu\": 3.6,\n667\t      \"calibration_mae_pp_7b_gsm8k\": 5.4,\n668\t      \"ci_coverage_95_7b\": 0.88,\n669\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_7b\": 11.2,\n670\t      \"kendall_tau_7b\": 0.76,\n671\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_7b\": 0.32,\n672\t      \"theta_corr_7b\": 0.86,\n673\t      \"mae_difference_3b_vs_7b\": 0.3,\n674\t      \"scale_regression_detected\": false\n675\t    },\n676\t    \"tables\": [\n677\t      {\n678\t        \"name\": \"Table: 7B vs 0.5-3B Calibration Comparison\",\n679\t        \"columns\": [\n680\t          \"metric\",\n681\t          \"0.5-3B avg\",\n682\t          \"7B\",\n683\t          \"delta\"\n684\t        ],\n685\t        \"rows\": [\n686\t          [\n687\t            \"MAE (pp)\",\n688\t            4.2,\n689\t            4.5,\n690\t            0.3\n691\t          ],\n692\t          [\n693\t            \"Coverage 95%\",\n694\t            0.89,\n695\t            0.88,\n696\t            -0.01\n697\t          ],\n698\t          [\n699\t            \"CI width (pp)\",\n700\t            10.8,\n701\t            11.2,\n702\t            0.4\n703\t          ],\n704\t          [\n705\t            \"Kendall τ\",\n706\t            0.78,\n707\t            0.76,\n708\t            -0.02\n709\t          ],\n710\t          [\n711\t            \"γ at 100% dose\",\n712\t            0.38,\n713\t            0.32,\n714\t            -0.06\n715\t          ]\n716\t        ]\n717\t      }\n718\t    ],\n719\t    \"figures\": [],\n720\t    \"analysis\": \"7B验证成功——无scale regression。MAE略升但在误差范围内。 论文可claim \\\"consistent results from 0.5B to 7B\\\" (4个scale points)。 这不能外推到72B+(需exp-012的observational data)。 γ的scale dependence(larger model→smaller γ)是interesting finding， 值得一段discussion但不影响core claims。\\n\\n\\nMedian档预期7B与0.5-3B结果一致(no scale regression)。7B inflation略低于 smaller models(base能力更高，SFT记忆的relative gain更小)。Calibration MAE (4.5pp)略高于3B(4.2pp)但差异不显著(0.3pp)——可能因7B SFT的LoRA rank需要 不同于smaller models、或7B的training dynamics使contamination effect less stereotyped(不完全符合4PL+γ的multiplicative assumption)。 CI coverage(0.88)和width(11.2pp)与smaller models一致。 γ posterior(0.32 at 100%)略低于smaller models(0.38)——符合\\\"更强base model contamination effect相对更小\\\"的直觉。No scale regression确认方法的scalability， 但不能从这一data point推断到72B+。\\n\"\n721\t  },\n722\t  {\n723\t    \"name\": \"signal_survival_analysis\",\n724\t    \"description\": \"检测信号在不同training regimes下的可靠性。4 signals × 4 regimes AUC heatmap。\\n\",\n725\t    \"results\": {\n726\t      \"embed_auc_base\": 0.84,\n727\t      \"minkpp_auc_base\": 0.8,\n728\t      \"constat_auc_base\": 0.76,\n729\t      \"selfcrit_auc_base\": 0.66,\n730\t      \"embed_auc_sft_clean\": 0.83,\n731\t      \"minkpp_auc_sft_clean\": 0.79,\n732\t      \"constat_auc_sft_clean\": 0.75,\n733\t      \"selfcrit_auc_sft_clean\": 0.65,\n734\t      \"embed_auc_sft_contam\": 0.82,\n735\t      \"minkpp_auc_sft_contam\": 0.78,\n736\t      \"constat_auc_sft_contam\": 0.74,\n737\t      \"selfcrit_auc_sft_contam\": 0.68,\n738\t      \"embed_auc_rl\": 0.58,\n739\t      \"minkpp_auc_rl\": 0.54,\n740\t      \"constat_auc_rl\": 0.56,\n741\t      \"selfcrit_auc_rl\": 0.63,\n742\t      \"max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_embed\": 0.26,\n743\t      \"max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_minkpp\": 0.26,\n744\t      \"selfcrit_rl_vs_sft_delta\": -0.05,\n745\t      \"selfcrit_is_best_signal_in_rl\": true\n746\t    },\n747\t    \"tables\": [\n748\t      {\n749\t        \"name\": \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\",\n750\t        \"columns\": [\n751\t          \"signal\",\n752\t          \"base\",\n753\t          \"SFT-clean\",\n754\t          \"SFT-contam\",\n755\t          \"RL-post\"\n756\t        ],\n757\t        \"rows\": [\n758\t          [\n759\t            \"Embedding\",\n760\t            0.84,\n761\t            0.83,\n762\t            0.82,\n763\t            0.58\n764\t          ],\n765\t          [\n766\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n767\t            0.8,\n768\t            0.79,\n769\t            0.78,\n770\t            0.54\n771\t          ],\n772\t          [\n773\t            \"ConStat\",\n774\t            0.76,\n775\t            0.75,\n776\t            0.74,\n777\t            0.56\n778\t          ],\n779\t          [\n780\t            \"Self-Critique\",\n781\t            0.66,\n782\t            0.65,\n783\t            0.68,\n784\t            0.63\n785\t          ]\n786\t        ]\n787\t      }\n788\t    ],\n789\t    \"figures\": [],\n790\t    \"analysis\": \"Signal survival直接支撑Claim 2的修改方向。核心narrative： (1) SFT regime下4-signal RRF有效(all AUC>0.65)。 (2) RL regime下仅Self-Critique存活(AUC=0.63)，其余3个<0.60(essentially chance+noise)。 (3) 这解释了RL case study(exp-009)为何CIs必须宽——信号质量不支持tighter inference。 (4) 此heatmap升级为Supporting Contribution 5，是paper的visual highlight。 论文需明确：RRF的\\\"graceful degradation\\\"在RL下并非gradual——是cliff effect， 只有Self-Critique survive。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的关键结果：RL post-training严重降解Embedding(0.84→0.58)和Min-K%++ (0.80→0.54)。原因：RL(GRPO/RLHF)改变了token distribution和embedding空间， 使基于原始模型logits/embeddings的检测方法失效——与fragility paper(arXiv 2510.02386) 一致。ConStat也降至0.56因为RL改变了model对original vs paraphrase items的 相对表现模式。\\nSelf-Critique是唯一在RL下保持有用性的信号(0.63)——虽然也从0.66降至0.63， 但降幅最小。原因：Self-Critique基于model的self-consistency/entropy而非 与training data的直接比较，RL改变了能力分布但未消除\\\"记忆性回答\\\"的 low-entropy特征。然而0.63仍然很低——接近exp-004确定的identifiability下限。\\nSFT-clean和base几乎相同(差异<0.02)——SFT本身不降解信号， 只有contaminated SFT才改变pattern(且改变方向是增强detection)。\\n\"\n791\t  },\n792\t  {\n793\t    \"name\": \"rl_observational_case_study\",\n794\t    \"description\": \"RL-trained models observational case study。Self-Critique + available signals, 宽CI拟合, expected regret quantification, near-zero γ specificity check。\\n\",\n795\t    \"results\": {\n796\t      \"models_analyzed\": 6,\n797\t      \"self_critique_auc_rl_avg\": 0.62,\n798\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_rl_avg\": 0.18,\n799\t      \"gamma_95ci_width_rl\": 0.41,\n800\t      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_fraction\": 0.33,\n801\t      \"theta_ci_width_95_pp_rl\": 17.4,\n802\t      \"calibration_adjustment_pp_avg\": 3.8,\n803\t      \"expected_regret_uncalibrated\": 0.42,\n804\t      \"expected_regret_calibrated\": 0.35,\n805\t      \"expected_regret_remove_rescore\": 0.39,\n806\t      \"regret_reduction_pct\": 0.17,\n807\t      \"gamma_clean_benchmark_mean\": 0.03,\n808\t      \"gamma_clean_benchmark_95ci_includes_zero\": true,\n809\t      \"qwen_instruct_avg_adjustment_pp\": 4.2,\n810\t      \"deepseek_r1_avg_adjustment_pp\": 3.1,\n811\t      \"max_rhat_rl\": 1.015,\n812\t      \"divergent_pct_rl\": 1.2,\n813\t      \"ess_bulk_min_rl\": 210\n814\t    },\n815\t    \"tables\": [\n816\t      {\n817\t        \"name\": \"Table: RL Case Study Results by Model\",\n818\t        \"columns\": [\n819\t          \"model\",\n820\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n821\t          \"gamma_95ci\",\n822\t          \"theta_adj_pp\",\n823\t          \"ci_width_pp\"\n824\t        ],\n825\t        \"rows\": [\n826\t          [\n827\t            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\",\n828\t            0.21,\n829\t            \"[-0.01, 0.44]\",\n830\t            4.8,\n831\t            18.2\n832\t          ],\n833\t          [\n834\t            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\",\n835\t            0.19,\n836\t            \"[0.02, 0.38]\",\n837\t            4.5,\n838\t            16.8\n839\t          ],\n840\t          [\n841\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\",\n842\t            0.17,\n843\t            \"[-0.04, 0.39]\",\n844\t            3.9,\n845\t            17.1\n846\t          ],\n847\t          [\n848\t            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n849\t            0.14,\n850\t            \"[-0.06, 0.35]\",\n851\t            3.6,\n852\t            17.8\n853\t          ],\n854\t          [\n855\t            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\",\n856\t            0.16,\n857\t            \"[-0.03, 0.36]\",\n858\t            3.3,\n859\t            16.9\n860\t          ],\n861\t          [\n862\t            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\",\n863\t            0.12,\n864\t            \"[-0.08, 0.33]\",\n865\t            2.8,\n866\t            17.6\n867\t          ]\n868\t        ]\n869\t      },\n870\t      {\n871\t        \"name\": \"Table: Expected Regret (Top-3 Selection)\",\n872\t        \"columns\": [\n873\t          \"method\",\n874\t          \"expected_regret\",\n875\t          \"regret_reduction\"\n876\t        ],\n877\t        \"rows\": [\n878\t          [\n879\t            \"Uncalibrated\",\n880\t            0.42,\n881\t            \"—\"\n882\t          ],\n883\t          [\n884\t            \"Remove-rescore\",\n885\t            0.39,\n886\t            \"7%\"\n887\t          ],\n888\t          [\n889\t            \"Calibrated (ours)\",\n890\t            0.35,\n891\t            \"17%\"\n892\t          ]\n893\t        ]\n894\t      }\n895\t    ],\n896\t    \"figures\": [],\n897\t    \"analysis\": \"RL case study honest framing：CIs宽(17pp)但这是correct answer——信号质量 不支持tight inference。Expected regret 17%改善说明即使wide CIs也有决策价值 (至少flag uncertainty)，但不能claim strong calibration。\\n论文Claim 3改写：从\\\"appropriately wider intervals\\\"到\\\"explicit uncertainty quantification revealing the practical limits of calibration under low-quality detection signals, with 17% expected regret reduction as the ceiling of achievable improvement\\\"。\\nSpecificity check通过是重要positive：确认γ≈0 on clean data， 方法不会false-alarm。MCMC diagnostics marginal但acceptable for observational study framing。\\n\\n\\nMedian档RL case study的核心特征：CIs非常宽(17.4pp)，expected regret改善 有限(17%)。原因链：Self-Critique AUC仅0.62 → γ posterior高度不确定 (CI width 0.41) → θ的counterfactual estimate也不确定 → CI width ~17pp。\\nγ仅在2/6 models的95%CI排除0——多数RL models的contamination effect 与noise不可区分。这不是方法失败而是诚实反映信号质量：当检测AUC≈0.62时， IRT正确地报告\\\"我们不确定\\\"。\\nExpected regret从0.42降至0.35(17%改善)——有帮助但不dramatic。 与uncalibrated相比，wide CIs至少告诉决策者\\\"这些rankings不可靠\\\"， 避免overconfident错误选择。Remove-rescore(0.39)介于两者之间。\\nNear-zero γ specificity check通过(γ=0.03, CI包含0)——确认模型不会 在clean data上hallucinate contamination effect。\\nMCMC diagnostics marginal(Rhat=1.015, divergent 1.2%, ESS=210)—— RL regime data更noisy导致posterior geometry更难采样。可以report但不致命。\\nDeepSeek-R1 adjustment(3.1pp)小于Qwen-Instruct(4.2pp)—— 可能因为distillation保留的contamination较少或training data composition不同。\\n\"\n898\t  },\n899\t  {\n900\t    \"name\": \"prior_sensitivity\",\n901\t    \"description\": \"γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)下重新拟合IRT，验证对prior选择的鲁棒性。\\n\",\n902\t    \"results\": {\n903\t      \"mae_prior_default\": 4.2,\n904\t      \"coverage_95_prior_default\": 0.89,\n905\t      \"gamma_mean_prior_default\": 0.38,\n906\t      \"mae_prior_tight\": 4.6,\n907\t      \"coverage_95_prior_tight\": 0.86,\n908\t      \"gamma_mean_prior_tight\": 0.31,\n909\t      \"gamma_shrinkage_tight\": 0.18,\n910\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_tight\": 9.8,\n911\t      \"mae_prior_wide\": 4.4,\n912\t      \"coverage_95_prior_wide\": 0.91,\n913\t      \"gamma_mean_prior_wide\": 0.42,\n914\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_wide\": 12.6,\n915\t      \"max_mae_delta_across_priors\": 0.4,\n916\t      \"max_gamma_delta_across_priors\": 0.11,\n917\t      \"ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_tight\": 0.94,\n918\t      \"ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_wide\": 0.96\n919\t    },\n920\t    \"tables\": [\n921\t      {\n922\t        \"name\": \"Table: Prior Sensitivity Results\",\n923\t        \"columns\": [\n924\t          \"prior\",\n925\t          \"MAE_pp\",\n926\t          \"coverage_95\",\n927\t          \"gamma_mean\",\n928\t          \"CI_width_pp\"\n929\t        ],\n930\t        \"rows\": [\n931\t          [\n932\t            \"N(0,0.5)\",\n933\t            4.6,\n934\t            0.86,\n935\t            0.31,\n936\t            9.8\n937\t          ],\n938\t          [\n939\t            \"N(0,1) default\",\n940\t            4.2,\n941\t            0.89,\n942\t            0.38,\n943\t            10.8\n944\t          ],\n945\t          [\n946\t            \"N(0,2)\",\n947\t            4.4,\n948\t            0.91,\n949\t            0.42,\n950\t            12.6\n951\t          ]\n952\t        ]\n953\t      }\n954\t    ],\n955\t    \"figures\": [],\n956\t    \"analysis\": \"Prior sensitivity通过。Results robust to 4× prior variance change (σ²: 0.25→4)。MAE变化<0.5pp, ranking几乎不变。 Appendix一表一图足以回应reviewer \\\"results prior-driven\\\" concern。 Default N(0,1)是合理选择：tight prior underestimates γ, wide prior adds noise。\\n\\n\\nMedian档prior sensitivity结果：N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 18%(0.38→0.31)使MAE 从4.2升至4.6pp——tight prior regularization过度抑制了contamination correction， 但degradation温和(<0.5pp)。N(0,2)使γ略增(0.42)和CI略宽(12.6pp vs 10.8pp)， MAE paradoxically增至4.4pp——wider prior允许更多posterior variance导致 point estimate less precise。\\n关键robustness指标：max MAE delta仅0.4pp(across priors)，rankings近乎不变 (τ>0.94)。这说明calibrated score和model ranking对prior选择robust， 虽然具体CI width有~3pp variation。Coverage与prior correlates correctly： wider prior→wider CI→better coverage(0.91 vs 0.86)。\\n足以在appendix展示\\\"results not prior-driven\\\"。\\n\"\n957\t  },\n958\t  {\n959\t    \"name\": \"few_examinee_regime\",\n960\t    \"description\": \"Simulation: IRT at model counts 20/50/100/200。Growing Pains pre-estimation策略评估。\\n\",\n961\t    \"results\": {\n962\t      \"naive_mae_n20\": 8.7,\n963\t      \"naive_mae_n50\": 5.4,\n964\t      \"naive_mae_n100\": 4.3,\n965\t      \"naive_mae_n200\": 3.9,\n966\t      \"naive_coverage_95_n20\": 0.78,\n967\t      \"naive_coverage_95_n50\": 0.86,\n968\t      \"naive_coverage_95_n100\": 0.9,\n969\t      \"naive_coverage_95_n200\": 0.93,\n970\t      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n20\": 0.38,\n971\t      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n50\": 0.19,\n972\t      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n100\": 0.12,\n973\t      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n200\": 0.08,\n974\t      \"gp_mae_n20\": 5.9,\n975\t      \"gp_mae_n50\": 4.4,\n976\t      \"gp_mae_n100\": 4.1,\n977\t      \"gp_mae_n200\": 3.8,\n978\t      \"gp_coverage_95_n20\": 0.85,\n979\t      \"gp_coverage_95_n50\": 0.89,\n980\t      \"gp_coverage_95_n100\": 0.91,\n981\t      \"gp_coverage_95_n200\": 0.93,\n982\t      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n20\": 0.22,\n983\t      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n50\": 0.14,\n984\t      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n100\": 0.1,\n985\t      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n200\": 0.07,\n986\t      \"mae_improvement_n20_pct\": 0.32,\n987\t      \"mae_improvement_n50_pct\": 0.19,\n988\t      \"mae_improvement_n100_pct\": 0.05,\n989\t      \"minimum_n_naive_mae_under_6pp\": 50,\n990\t      \"minimum_n_gp_mae_under_6pp\": 20\n991\t    },\n992\t    \"tables\": [\n993\t      {\n994\t        \"name\": \"Table: Few-Examinee Regime Results\",\n995\t        \"columns\": [\n996\t          \"N_models\",\n997\t          \"naive_MAE\",\n998\t          \"GP_MAE\",\n999\t          \"improvement\",\n1000\t          \"naive_cov95\",\n1001\t          \"GP_cov95\"\n1002\t        ],\n1003\t        \"rows\": [\n1004\t          [\n1005\t            20,\n1006\t            8.7,\n1007\t            5.9,\n1008\t            \"32%\",\n1009\t            0.78,\n1010\t            0.85\n1011\t          ],\n1012\t          [\n1013\t            50,\n1014\t            5.4,\n1015\t            4.4,\n1016\t            \"19%\",\n1017\t            0.86,\n1018\t            0.89\n1019\t          ],\n1020\t          [\n1021\t            100,\n1022\t            4.3,\n1023\t            4.1,\n1024\t            \"5%\",\n1025\t            0.9,\n1026\t            0.91\n1027\t          ],\n1028\t          [\n1029\t            200,\n1030\t            3.9,\n1031\t            3.8,\n1032\t            \"3%\",\n1033\t            0.93,\n1034\t            0.93\n1035\t          ]\n1036\t        ]\n1037\t      }\n1038\t    ],\n1039\t    \"figures\": [],\n1040\t    \"analysis\": \"GP策略is a genuine contribution for median tier——它将practical applicability 扩展到小样本场景。N=20 GP MAE=5.9pp刚好在median acceptable range， 回应reviewer concern \\\"too few models\\\"。 论文framing：Section 4.x \\\"Practical Considerations: Few-Examinee Regime\\\"， 展示GP as recommended practice when N<50。 但需诚实：N=20仍比N=100差(5.9 vs 4.1pp)，GP不是magic bullet。\\n\\n\\nMedian档few-examinee结果：N=20时naive estimation崩溃(MAE=8.7pp, coverage=0.78, γ bias=38%)——4PL+γ有太多参数(4 item params × I items + θ + γ per model) 相对于20个models严重欠定。Growing Pains pre-estimation将item params固定在 来自400+ model pool的先验上，仅估θ和γ——这将N=20 MAE从8.7pp降至5.9pp(32%改善)， coverage从0.78升至0.85。\\n但即使有GP策略，N=20的结果仍marginal(MAE=5.9pp在median范围上限)，因为 pre-estimated item params来自不同model pool，transfer assumption imperfect。 N=50时差异缩小(5.4→4.4pp, 19%)，N=100时几乎无差异(4.3→4.1pp)—— 充足数据时direct estimation接近GP估计。\\n关键结论：GP策略将\\\"最小可用模型数\\\"从50降至20，但N=20仍应被标注为 \\\"reduced confidence\\\"。论文可claim \\\"practical for N≥20 with informative priors\\\" 而非\\\"works with any N\\\"。\\n\"\n1041\t  },\n1042\t  {\n1043\t    \"name\": \"observational_72b\",\n1044\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only)。Frontier scale ecological validity。\\n\",\n1045\t    \"results\": {\n1046\t      \"self_critique_auc_72b_estimated\": 0.61,\n1047\t      \"constat_auc_72b_estimated\": 0.55,\n1048\t      \"gamma_posterior_mean_72b\": 0.1,\n1049\t      \"gamma_95ci\": \"[-0.09, 0.30]\",\n1050\t      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero\": false,\n1051\t      \"theta_ci_width_95_pp\": 14.8,\n1052\t      \"calibration_adjustment_pp\": 2.1,\n1053\t      \"gamma_72b_vs_7b_instruct_difference\": -0.04,\n1054\t      \"ranking_consistency_with_smaller\": true\n1055\t    },\n1056\t    \"tables\": [\n1057\t      {\n1058\t        \"name\": \"Table: 72B Observational Results\",\n1059\t        \"columns\": [\n1060\t          \"metric\",\n1061\t          \"value\"\n1062\t        ],\n1063\t        \"rows\": [\n1064\t          [\n1065\t            \"Self-Critique AUC (est.)\",\n1066\t            0.61\n1067\t          ],\n1068\t          [\n1069\t            \"γ posterior mean\",\n1070\t            0.1\n1071\t          ],\n1072\t          [\n1073\t            \"γ 95% CI\",\n1074\t            \"[-0.09, 0.30]\"\n1075\t          ],\n1076\t          [\n1077\t            \"Calibration adj. (pp)\",\n1078\t            2.1\n1079\t          ],\n1080\t          [\n1081\t            \"θ CI width (pp)\",\n1082\t            14.8\n1083\t          ]\n1084\t        ]\n1085\t      }\n1086\t    ],\n1087\t    \"figures\": [],\n1088\t    \"analysis\": \"72B data point is weak but not harmful。γ CI包含0，无法claim或refute contamination。论文可以说\\\"extending to 72B, we observe no evidence of scale-specific artifacts, though signal quality at this scale limits definitive conclusions\\\"。P2 priority justified——nice to have, not essential。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下72B observational是最弱的data point。原因：(1) 仅有Self-Critique和 ConStat可用(closed-weight限制embed/MinK)，AUC约0.55-0.61——接近chance。 (2) 单一模型(N=1 for this scale)使IRT估计极度依赖item-level variation。 (3) γ posterior CI包含0——无法conclude contamination effect。\\n但γ point estimate(0.10)较低且calibration adjustment小(2.1pp)—— 与72B模型更大training corpus下contamination\\\"稀释\\\"一致。 排名与smaller models一致(no scale-specific anomaly)。\\n论文定位：一段discussion + appendix table。不能support quantitative claims， 仅提供\\\"no evidence of scale regression\\\"的directional observation。\\n\"\n1089\t  },\n1090\t  {\n1091\t    \"name\": \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\",\n1092\t    \"description\": \"2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique)。量化vs 4-signal calibration gap。\\n\",\n1093\t    \"results\": {\n1094\t      \"two_signal_rrf_auc\": 0.7,\n1095\t      \"mae_2signal_avg\": 5.4,\n1096\t      \"mae_2signal_mmlu\": 4.3,\n1097\t      \"mae_2signal_gsm8k\": 6.5,\n1098\t      \"mae_2signal_arc\": 4.9,\n1099\t      \"mae_2signal_humaneval\": 6.8,\n1100\t      \"ci_coverage_95_2signal\": 0.85,\n1101\t      \"ci_width_95_pp_2signal\": 13.8,\n1102\t      \"kendall_tau_2signal\": 0.68,\n1103\t      \"mae_increase_relative\": 0.29,\n1104\t      \"coverage_decrease\": 0.04,\n1105\t      \"ci_width_increase_pp\": 3.0,\n1106\t      \"tau_decrease\": 0.1,\n1107\t      \"degradation_worst_benchmark\": \"HumanEval\",\n1108\t      \"degradation_worst_mae_increase\": 1.2\n1109\t    },\n1110\t    \"tables\": [\n1111\t      {\n1112\t        \"name\": \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration\",\n1113\t        \"columns\": [\n1114\t          \"metric\",\n1115\t          \"4-signal\",\n1116\t          \"2-signal\",\n1117\t          \"degradation\"\n1118\t        ],\n1119\t        \"rows\": [\n1120\t          [\n1121\t            \"RRF AUC\",\n1122\t            0.78,\n1123\t            0.7,\n1124\t            \"-0.08\"\n1125\t          ],\n1126\t          [\n1127\t            \"MAE avg (pp)\",\n1128\t            4.2,\n1129\t            5.4,\n1130\t            \"+1.2 (29%)\"\n1131\t          ],\n1132\t          [\n1133\t            \"Coverage 95%\",\n1134\t            0.89,\n1135\t            0.85,\n1136\t            \"-0.04\"\n1137\t          ],\n1138\t          [\n1139\t            \"CI width (pp)\",\n1140\t            10.8,\n1141\t            13.8,\n1142\t            \"+3.0\"\n1143\t          ],\n1144\t          [\n1145\t            \"Kendall τ\",\n1146\t            0.78,\n1147\t            0.68,\n1148\t            \"-0.10\"\n1149\t          ]\n1150\t        ]\n1151\t      },\n1152\t      {\n1153\t        \"name\": \"Table: 2-Signal MAE by Benchmark\",\n1154\t        \"columns\": [\n1155\t          \"benchmark\",\n1156\t          \"4-signal MAE\",\n1157\t          \"2-signal MAE\",\n1158\t          \"delta\"\n1159\t        ],\n1160\t        \"rows\": [\n1161\t          [\n1162\t            \"MMLU\",\n1163\t            3.4,\n1164\t            4.3,\n1165\t            0.9\n1166\t          ],\n1167\t          [\n1168\t            \"GSM8K\",\n1169\t            5.1,\n1170\t            6.5,\n1171\t            1.4\n1172\t          ],\n1173\t          [\n1174\t            \"ARC-C\",\n1175\t            3.8,\n1176\t            4.9,\n1177\t            1.1\n1178\t          ],\n1179\t          [\n1180\t            \"HumanEval\",\n1181\t            5.6,\n1182\t            6.8,\n1183\t            1.2\n1184\t          ]\n1185\t        ]\n1186\t      }\n1187\t    ],\n1188\t    \"figures\": [],\n1189\t    \"analysis\": \"2-signal mode functional但clearly inferior。29% MAE degradation是 \\\"graceful degradation\\\"的上限——再去掉一个信号(1-signal)会cross usability boundary。论文framing：2-signal mode作为\\\"accessible fallback for closed-weight evaluation, with explicit performance penalty disclosure\\\"。 不应claim 2-signal mode等效于4-signal。 建议在paper中加warning box：\\\"2-signal mode is recommended only when model internals are unavailable. Users should expect ~30% higher calibration error and wider confidence intervals.\\\"\\n\\nMedian档2-signal degradation约29%相对MAE增加，在[0.15, 0.35]范围中段。 Composite AUC从0.78降至0.70——恰好在identifiability threshold边缘。 MAE从4.2升至5.4pp——仍然functional但不impressive。\\n降级对HumanEval打击最大(5.6→6.8pp)因为code benchmarks的两个surviving signals 都最弱(ConStat和Self-Critique在HumanEval AUC最低)。MMLU降级最小(3.4→4.3pp) 因为即使只用两个信号MMLU的MC格式仍提供较好的ConStat performance gap。\\nCoverage从0.89降至0.85——低于nominal但仍>0.80。CI从10.8宽到13.8pp—— 接近\\\"不太有用\\\"的boundary(15pp)但还没到。\\nKendall τ降至0.68——model ranking reliability受影响，3-4个model pairs可能错序。 这限制了2-signal mode在competitive benchmarking(排名靠前的模型精确排序) 中的应用，但对\\\"flagging severely contaminated models\\\"仍有价值。\\n\"\n1190\t  }\n1191\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89da9859-15db-4179-8886-b039b6c84f22","uuid":"3d718d83-10c5-4239-a458-957ce6fb73f8","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:11:04.984Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T155040/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"controlled_sft_injection\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B 在 5 个 dosage (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) 下的 SFT 注入。 15 runs 产出 ground-truth contaminated/clean model pairs。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_0.5B\": 11.2,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_1.5B\": 9.4,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_3B\": 7.8,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_0.5B\": 14.6,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_1.5B\": 12.1,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_3B\": 10.3,\n      \"arc_inflation_100pct_0.5B\": 8.7,\n      \"arc_inflation_100pct_1.5B\": 7.2,\n      \"arc_inflation_100pct_3B\": 6.1,\n      \"humaneval_inflation_100pct_0.5B\": 9.8,\n      \"humaneval_inflation_100pct_1.5B\": 8.5,\n      \"humaneval_100pct_3B\": 7.0,\n      \"mmlu_inflation_5pct_avg\": 1.8,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_5pct_avg\": 2.4,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_mmlu\": 0.98,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_gsm8k\": 0.92,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_arc\": 0.96,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_humaneval\": 0.88,\n      \"sft_loss_converged_fraction\": 1.0,\n      \"clean_sft_accuracy_degradation_max_pp\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Score Inflation by Dosage and Scale\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"0%\",\n          \"5%\",\n          \"25%\",\n          \"50%\",\n          \"100%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            42.1,\n            43.9,\n            48.3,\n            50.7,\n            53.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            18.3,\n            20.7,\n            26.1,\n            29.4,\n            32.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            35.8,\n            36.9,\n            40.2,\n            42.1,\n            44.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B\",\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            12.2,\n            13.4,\n            17.1,\n            19.8,\n            22.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            56.4,\n            57.8,\n            61.2,\n            63.1,\n            65.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            38.7,\n            40.4,\n            45.3,\n            48.0,\n            50.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            48.2,\n            49.1,\n            52.0,\n            53.6,\n            55.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            26.8,\n            28.0,\n            31.4,\n            33.2,\n            35.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            64.7,\n            65.8,\n            68.4,\n            70.1,\n            72.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            52.1,\n            53.6,\n            57.2,\n            59.5,\n            62.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            55.3,\n            56.1,\n            58.6,\n            60.0,\n            61.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            35.4,\n            36.2,\n            39.0,\n            40.8,\n            42.4\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Injection成功产生可控contamination。关键观察：(1) inflation magnitude随scale递减， 与模型base能力挤占记忆增益一致。(2) GSM8K inflation最大但dose-response 仍单调(Spearman>0.9)。(3) HumanEval在0.5B上100% dosage略低于预期—— execution-based eval的pass@1对记忆错误更敏感。(4) Clean SFT(0% dosage) 无显著退化(<1pp)，确保ground truth baseline可靠。 这组数据为exp-002/003/006提供了足够的contamination variation。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下SFT injection按预期产生系统性inflation。较小模型(0.5B)inflation更大， 因为base能力低、SFT对记忆benchmark items的relative gain更高。GSM8K inflation 最大因为free-form格式下memorization直接消除reasoning需求。HumanEval的 dose-response不完美(Spearman=0.88)，因代码生成的execution-based评估部分抵消了 记忆效应——背下答案但execution环境稍有差异导致100% dosage不一定比50%高。 5% dosage inflation小但非零(1.8-2.4pp)，为后续检测设置了\\\"低信号\\\"基准。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"stage1_signal_pipeline\",\n    \"description\": \"在exp-001全部模型上计算4个检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++, ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embedding_retrieval_auc_sft\": 0.82,\n      \"minkpp_auc_sft\": 0.78,\n      \"constat_auc_sft\": 0.74,\n      \"self_critique_auc_sft\": 0.68,\n      \"embedding_auc_mmlu\": 0.85,\n      \"embedding_auc_gsm8k\": 0.79,\n      \"embedding_auc_arc\": 0.83,\n      \"embedding_auc_humaneval\": 0.76,\n      \"minkpp_auc_mmlu\": 0.81,\n      \"minkpp_auc_gsm8k\": 0.75,\n      \"minkpp_auc_arc\": 0.79,\n      \"minkpp_auc_humaneval\": 0.72,\n      \"constat_auc_mmlu\": 0.77,\n      \"constat_auc_gsm8k\": 0.72,\n      \"constat_auc_arc\": 0.75,\n      \"constat_auc_humaneval\": 0.68,\n      \"self_critique_auc_mmlu\": 0.71,\n      \"self_critique_auc_gsm8k\": 0.65,\n      \"self_critique_auc_arc\": 0.69,\n      \"self_critique_auc_humaneval\": 0.63,\n      \"corr_embed_minkpp\": 0.58,\n      \"corr_embed_constat\": 0.42,\n      \"corr_embed_selfcritique\": 0.31,\n      \"corr_minkpp_constat\": 0.47,\n      \"corr_minkpp_selfcritique\": 0.29,\n      \"corr_constat_selfcritique\": 0.38,\n      \"fpr_at_tpr80_embedding\": 0.14,\n      \"fpr_at_tpr80_minkpp\": 0.18,\n      \"fpr_at_tpr80_constat\": 0.22,\n      \"fpr_at_tpr80_selfcritique\": 0.28\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Detection Signal AUC by Benchmark (SFT regime)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"GSM8K\",\n          \"ARC-C\",\n          \"HumanEval\",\n          \"avg\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding Retrieval\",\n            0.85,\n            0.79,\n            0.83,\n            0.76,\n            0.82\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.81,\n            0.75,\n            0.79,\n            0.72,\n            0.78\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.77,\n            0.72,\n            0.75,\n            0.68,\n            0.74\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.71,\n            0.65,\n            0.69,\n            0.63,\n            0.68\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Inter-signal Spearman Correlation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal_pair\",\n          \"correlation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embed × MinK++\",\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Embed × ConStat\",\n            0.42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Embed × SelfCrit\",\n            0.31\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MinK++ × ConStat\",\n            0.47\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MinK++ × SelfCrit\",\n            0.29\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat × SelfCrit\",\n            0.38\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"信号质量验证了median假设：平均AUC在0.68-0.82范围，整体RRF输入AUC约0.75。 关键发现：(1) 信号间相关性中等偏低(avg≈0.41)，互补性足够支撑RRF。 (2) HumanEval是最难检测的benchmark，所有信号AUC低4-9pp。 (3) Self-Critique的AUC(0.68)低于其他但仍>0.60，符合median预期。 (4) 0% dosage FPR可控(14-28% at TPR=80%)，不会严重污染RRF输入。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下，检测信号AUC在0.70-0.80整体范围。Embedding retrieval最强(0.82)因为 SFT injection用paraphrases仍保留semantic proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.78)因为 SFT直接影响token-level log-probabilities。ConStat第三(0.74)因为original vs paraphrase performance gap需要足够dosage才稳定。Self-Critique最弱(0.68)因为 entropy-based信号本质上noise更大——但它是唯一不依赖logits/embeddings的信号， 对closed-weight场景有独占价值。HumanEval各信号AUC最低：代码生成的 token分布更irregular，embedding space对code的semantic retrieval效果较差。 信号间中等相关(0.29-0.58)确认它们捕获不同维度的contamination evidence， 为RRF fusion提供互补性基础。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rrf_aggregation_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"RRF fusion及消融实验。比较RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal, calibration-weighted RRF, FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rrf_4signal_auc\": 0.78,\n      \"equal_weight_avg_auc\": 0.76,\n      \"calibration_weighted_rrf_auc\": 0.77,\n      \"best_single_signal_auc\": 0.75,\n      \"second_best_single_auc\": 0.72,\n      \"worst_single_signal_auc\": 0.63,\n      \"degraded_2signal_auc\": 0.7,\n      \"delta_auc_rrf_vs_best_single\": 0.03,\n      \"rrf_auc_after_10pct_fp\": 0.75,\n      \"rrf_auc_after_20pct_fp\": 0.72,\n      \"rrf_auc_mmlu\": 0.82,\n      \"rrf_auc_gsm8k\": 0.75,\n      \"rrf_auc_arc\": 0.8,\n      \"rrf_auc_humaneval\": 0.72,\n      \"rrf_precision_at_20\": 0.71,\n      \"best_single_precision_at_20\": 0.66\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"Prec@20%\",\n          \"notes\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RRF (4 signals)\",\n            0.78,\n            0.71,\n            \"\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Equal-weight rank avg\",\n            0.76,\n            0.68,\n            \"\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Calib-weighted RRF\",\n            0.77,\n            0.69,\n            \"slight overfit\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Best single (Embedding)\",\n            0.75,\n            0.66,\n            \"\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++ only\",\n            0.72,\n            0.62,\n            \"\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat only\",\n            0.68,\n            0.57,\n            \"\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique only\",\n            0.63,\n            0.51,\n            \"\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2-signal degraded\",\n            0.7,\n            0.59,\n            \"ConStat+SelfCrit\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: FP Injection Robustness\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"fp_rate_injected\",\n          \"rrf_auc\",\n          \"delta_from_clean\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0%\",\n            0.78,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10%\",\n            0.75,\n            -0.03\n          ],\n          [\n            \"20%\",\n            0.72,\n            -0.06\n          ],\n          [\n            \"30%\",\n            0.67,\n            -0.11\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RRF的优势存在但modest(ΔAUC=0.03)。这直接影响Claim 2的framing： 不应claim \\\"outperforming any single signal\\\" 而应强调 \\\"robust aggregation\\\"—— RRF的真正价值在FP robustness和2-signal fallback而非peak AUC。 2-signal mode AUC=0.70恰好在identifiability阈值边缘，需要在论文中 明确标注\\\"minimum recommended configuration\\\"。 Calibration-weighted RRF表现不如vanilla RRF，支持\\\"meta-circularity avoidance\\\" 的设计选择——无需训练信号权重。\\n\\n\\nMedian档核心特征：RRF优于best single signal但ΔAUC仅0.03。原因在于 信号AUC本身在0.68-0.82范围——并非极低(此时aggregation大幅增益)也非极高 (此时ceiling限制增益)。四个信号的互补性(avg correlation≈0.41)提供了 理论上的融合空间，但实际上Embedding Retrieval已是dominant signal(AUC=0.82)， 其余三个信号的incremental information有限。Equal-weight averaging(0.76) 接近RRF(0.78)因为信号质量差异不大到需要rank-based down-weighting。 Calibration-weighted RRF(0.77)反而略低于vanilla RRF——过拟合少量 calibration data。2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+SelfCrit)AUC=0.70， 损失明显但仍在median认为\\\"可用\\\"的AUC≥0.70阈值边缘。 FP injection显示RRF对噪声有中等鲁棒性：10% FP仅降3pp，20% FP降6pp。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"noise_propagation_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"校准噪声注入实验。估计Self-Critique FP/FN率，注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声， 重新拟合IRT并量化CI widening。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"self_critique_fpr_estimated\": 0.25,\n      \"self_critique_fnr_estimated\": 0.32,\n      \"gamma_ci_width_matched_noise\": 0.42,\n      \"gamma_ci_width_1.5x_noise\": 0.58,\n      \"gamma_ci_width_2x_noise\": 0.78,\n      \"gamma_ci_width_clean_exposure\": 0.31,\n      \"theta_ci_width_matched_noise_pp\": 9.2,\n      \"theta_ci_width_1.5x_noise_pp\": 12.1,\n      \"theta_ci_width_2x_noise_pp\": 15.8,\n      \"theta_ci_width_clean_exposure_pp\": 7.4,\n      \"gamma_bias_matched_noise\": 0.04,\n      \"gamma_bias_1.5x_noise\": 0.08,\n      \"gamma_bias_2x_noise\": 0.14,\n      \"coverage_95_matched\": 0.91,\n      \"coverage_95_1.5x\": 0.89,\n      \"coverage_95_2x\": 0.86,\n      \"measurement_error_model_coverage_2x\": 0.92\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Noise Propagation Effects\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"noise_level\",\n          \"gamma_CI_width\",\n          \"theta_CI_pp\",\n          \"gamma_bias\",\n          \"coverage_95\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Clean exposure\",\n            0.31,\n            7.4,\n            0.0,\n            0.94\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Matched (1×)\",\n            0.42,\n            9.2,\n            0.04,\n            0.91\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.5×\",\n            0.58,\n            12.1,\n            0.08,\n            0.89\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2×\",\n            0.78,\n            15.8,\n            0.14,\n            0.86\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2× + meas. error model\",\n            0.65,\n            13.4,\n            0.06,\n            0.92\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"核心结论：Bayesian框架在matched noise下表现稳健(coverage 0.91, CI合理宽)， 但2× noise处于实用性边界。这直接为Claim 3定义了操作条件： \\\"当检测信号FPR>25%且FNR>30%(即AUC<0.65)时，CI宽度超过15pp， calibrated score的决策价值有限。\\\"  Measurement error model是值得mention但非paper核心贡献的extension。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下noise propagation体现为：matched noise使CI从7.4pp宽到9.2pp(+24%)， 这是合理的——exposure scores的测量误差传递到posterior但被Bayesian框架部分吸收。 2× noise时CI宽到15.8pp，逼近\\\"not practically useful\\\"的边界。 γ point estimate在matched noise下bias很小(0.04)，但2× noise下bias升至0.14—— 显示极端噪声不仅增加variance还引入bias(因为噪声对contaminated和clean items 的影响不对称)。Coverage在2× noise下降至0.86——低于nominal 0.95但仍>0.80， 说明model misspecification(未建模heteroscedastic noise)有代价但不灾难性。 Measurement error model extension能将2× noise coverage恢复至0.92， 表明显式建模noise是可行改进方向。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"irt_calibration_and_baselines\",\n    \"description\": \"4PL+γ IRT拟合与5个baseline对比。5个评估metric。核心实验。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_avg\": 4.2,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_mmlu\": 3.4,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_gsm8k\": 5.1,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_arc\": 3.8,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_humaneval\": 5.6,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_avg\": 0.89,\n      \"ci_coverage_80_avg\": 0.76,\n      \"ci_coverage_50_avg\": 0.48,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_avg\": 10.8,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_mmlu\": 8.9,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_gsm8k\": 12.4,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_arc\": 9.6,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_humaneval\": 13.2,\n      \"kendall_tau_avg\": 0.78,\n      \"kendall_tau_mmlu\": 0.84,\n      \"kendall_tau_gsm8k\": 0.73,\n      \"kendall_tau_arc\": 0.81,\n      \"kendall_tau_humaneval\": 0.71,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_avg\": 0.83,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_mmlu\": 0.92,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_gsm8k\": 0.78,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_arc\": 0.88,\n      \"dose_response_spearman_humaneval\": 0.74,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_dose\": 0.38,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_50pct_dose\": 0.22,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_25pct_dose\": 0.11,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_5pct_dose\": 0.04,\n      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_25pct\": true,\n      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_5pct\": false,\n      \"gamma_rel_bias_vs_ground_truth\": 0.14,\n      \"theta_gamma_posterior_corr\": 0.38,\n      \"theta_corr_with_ground_truth\": 0.87,\n      \"max_rhat\": 1.008,\n      \"divergent_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"ess_bulk_min\": 380,\n      \"fit_time_sec_per_benchmark\": 2400,\n      \"baseline_remove_rescore_mae\": 5.8,\n      \"baseline_single_2pl_gamma_mae\": 5.4,\n      \"baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae\": 7.1,\n      \"baseline_linear_regression_ci_mae\": 4.9,\n      \"baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae\": 8.2,\n      \"margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative\": 0.14,\n      \"baseline_linear_regression_ci_coverage_95\": 0.83,\n      \"baseline_single_2pl_gamma_coverage_95\": 0.81,\n      \"baseline_vanilla_4pl_coverage_95\": 0.72\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"GSM8K\",\n          \"ARC-C\",\n          \"HumanEval\",\n          \"avg\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"4PL+γ (ours)\",\n            3.4,\n            5.1,\n            3.8,\n            5.6,\n            4.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Remove-rescore\",\n            4.6,\n            7.2,\n            5.3,\n            6.8,\n            5.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Single-signal 2PL+γ\",\n            4.2,\n            6.3,\n            5.0,\n            6.4,\n            5.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Vanilla 4PL\",\n            5.8,\n            8.4,\n            6.5,\n            8.1,\n            7.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear reg. + CI\",\n            4.1,\n            5.8,\n            4.5,\n            5.9,\n            4.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Emperor mitigations\",\n            6.8,\n            9.7,\n            7.4,\n            9.2,\n            8.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Coverage and Sharpness\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"cov_50%\",\n          \"cov_80%\",\n          \"cov_95%\",\n          \"width_95_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"4PL+γ\",\n            0.48,\n            0.76,\n            0.89,\n            10.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear reg. + CI\",\n            0.42,\n            0.68,\n            0.83,\n            9.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Single-signal 2PL+γ\",\n            0.39,\n            0.64,\n            0.81,\n            11.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Vanilla 4PL\",\n            0.35,\n            0.58,\n            0.72,\n            8.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Dose-Response γ Posterior\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dosage\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_95ci_lo\",\n          \"gamma_95ci_hi\",\n          \"excludes_zero\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            0.04,\n            -0.02,\n            0.11,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"25%\",\n            0.11,\n            0.02,\n            0.21,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            0.22,\n            0.1,\n            0.35,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"100%\",\n            0.38,\n            0.23,\n            0.54,\n            true\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"4PL+γ是最佳方法但优势不dramatic——median的标志性结论。三个层面的implication： (1) vs Linear reg: IRT的额外复杂度justified(coverage 89% vs 83%, 正确的uncertainty 是核心contribution)但MAE gain modest(14%相对改善)。论文需强调uncertainty quality 而非point estimate accuracy。 (2) vs Vanilla 4PL: γ建模确认有价值(MAE 4.2 vs 7.1)，这是最clean的ablation。 (3) Claim 1需条件限定：在MMLU/ARC上MAE 3-4pp可以claim\\\"有效校准\\\"； 在GSM8K/HumanEval上5-6pp需诚实报告并讨论limitation。 γ在5% dosage不可识别，论文应明确标注minimum detectable effect。\\n\\n\\nMedian档核心特征：4PL+γ MAE=4.2pp，优于baselines但linear regression+CI 紧随(MAE=4.9pp, margin仅14%)。MMLU表现最好(MAE=3.4pp)因为MC格式稳定、 检测信号强、items数多(14K)利于IRT估计。HumanEval最差(MAE=5.6pp)因为 execution-based评估引入额外噪声、code embedding检测AUC低、items少(164)。 GSM8K次差(5.1pp)因free-form评估和检测信号在reasoning tasks上的弱化。\\nCoverage 89%低于nominal 95%——median档的标志性结果，说明model有轻微 misspecification(真实contamination effect非严格multiplicative, 或item parameters非严格4PL)。CI宽度10.8pp处于[8,14]区间中段。\\nKendall τ=0.78说明calibrated ranking大致正确但有1-2个model pairs 顺序错位——dosage相近的models(如25% vs 50% on GSM8K)难以排序。\\nγ在25%+ dosage可识别(CI excludes 0)但5% dosage不行——这是median的关键limitation。 θ-γ posterior correlation=0.38反映中等confounding(能力高的模型也倾向被更多 contaminate，IRT需要disentangle但不完美)。\\nVanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE最大(7.1pp)确认contamination建模有价值。 Emperor mitigations最差(8.2pp)确认post-hoc mitigation失效(与ICML 2025一致)。 Linear regression+CI(4.9pp)出人意料地近——在MMLU上甚至4.1pp(接近4PL+γ的3.4pp)， 因为MC benchmark上contamination effect近似线性。但它的coverage仅0.83(vs 0.89)， 不确定性估计较差。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"scale_bridging_7b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。验证calibration scales to 7B。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mmlu_inflation_100pct_7b\": 6.2,\n      \"gsm8k_inflation_100pct_7b\": 8.4,\n      \"arc_inflation_100pct_7b\": 5.0,\n      \"humaneval_inflation_100pct_7b\": 5.8,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_7b_avg\": 4.5,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_7b_mmlu\": 3.6,\n      \"calibration_mae_pp_7b_gsm8k\": 5.4,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_7b\": 0.88,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_7b\": 11.2,\n      \"kendall_tau_7b\": 0.76,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_7b\": 0.32,\n      \"theta_corr_7b\": 0.86,\n      \"mae_difference_3b_vs_7b\": 0.3,\n      \"scale_regression_detected\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 7B vs 0.5-3B Calibration Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"0.5-3B avg\",\n          \"7B\",\n          \"delta\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MAE (pp)\",\n            4.2,\n            4.5,\n            0.3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Coverage 95%\",\n            0.89,\n            0.88,\n            -0.01\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI width (pp)\",\n            10.8,\n            11.2,\n            0.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Kendall τ\",\n            0.78,\n            0.76,\n            -0.02\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ at 100% dose\",\n            0.38,\n            0.32,\n            -0.06\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"7B验证成功——无scale regression。MAE略升但在误差范围内。 论文可claim \\\"consistent results from 0.5B to 7B\\\" (4个scale points)。 这不能外推到72B+(需exp-012的observational data)。 γ的scale dependence(larger model→smaller γ)是interesting finding， 值得一段discussion但不影响core claims。\\n\\n\\nMedian档预期7B与0.5-3B结果一致(no scale regression)。7B inflation略低于 smaller models(base能力更高，SFT记忆的relative gain更小)。Calibration MAE (4.5pp)略高于3B(4.2pp)但差异不显著(0.3pp)——可能因7B SFT的LoRA rank需要 不同于smaller models、或7B的training dynamics使contamination effect less stereotyped(不完全符合4PL+γ的multiplicative assumption)。 CI coverage(0.88)和width(11.2pp)与smaller models一致。 γ posterior(0.32 at 100%)略低于smaller models(0.38)——符合\\\"更强base model contamination effect相对更小\\\"的直觉。No scale regression确认方法的scalability， 但不能从这一data point推断到72B+。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"signal_survival_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"检测信号在不同training regimes下的可靠性。4 signals × 4 regimes AUC heatmap。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embed_auc_base\": 0.84,\n      \"minkpp_auc_base\": 0.8,\n      \"constat_auc_base\": 0.76,\n      \"selfcrit_auc_base\": 0.66,\n      \"embed_auc_sft_clean\": 0.83,\n      \"minkpp_auc_sft_clean\": 0.79,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_clean\": 0.75,\n      \"selfcrit_auc_sft_clean\": 0.65,\n      \"embed_auc_sft_contam\": 0.82,\n      \"minkpp_auc_sft_contam\": 0.78,\n      \"constat_auc_sft_contam\": 0.74,\n      \"selfcrit_auc_sft_contam\": 0.68,\n      \"embed_auc_rl\": 0.58,\n      \"minkpp_auc_rl\": 0.54,\n      \"constat_auc_rl\": 0.56,\n      \"selfcrit_auc_rl\": 0.63,\n      \"max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_embed\": 0.26,\n      \"max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_minkpp\": 0.26,\n      \"selfcrit_rl_vs_sft_delta\": -0.05,\n      \"selfcrit_is_best_signal_in_rl\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"base\",\n          \"SFT-clean\",\n          \"SFT-contam\",\n          \"RL-post\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Embedding\",\n            0.84,\n            0.83,\n            0.82,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            0.8,\n            0.79,\n            0.78,\n            0.54\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            0.76,\n            0.75,\n            0.74,\n            0.56\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique\",\n            0.66,\n            0.65,\n            0.68,\n            0.63\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Signal survival直接支撑Claim 2的修改方向。核心narrative： (1) SFT regime下4-signal RRF有效(all AUC>0.65)。 (2) RL regime下仅Self-Critique存活(AUC=0.63)，其余3个<0.60(essentially chance+noise)。 (3) 这解释了RL case study(exp-009)为何CIs必须宽——信号质量不支持tighter inference。 (4) 此heatmap升级为Supporting Contribution 5，是paper的visual highlight。 论文需明确：RRF的\\\"graceful degradation\\\"在RL下并非gradual——是cliff effect， 只有Self-Critique survive。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的关键结果：RL post-training严重降解Embedding(0.84→0.58)和Min-K%++ (0.80→0.54)。原因：RL(GRPO/RLHF)改变了token distribution和embedding空间， 使基于原始模型logits/embeddings的检测方法失效——与fragility paper(arXiv 2510.02386) 一致。ConStat也降至0.56因为RL改变了model对original vs paraphrase items的 相对表现模式。\\nSelf-Critique是唯一在RL下保持有用性的信号(0.63)——虽然也从0.66降至0.63， 但降幅最小。原因：Self-Critique基于model的self-consistency/entropy而非 与training data的直接比较，RL改变了能力分布但未消除\\\"记忆性回答\\\"的 low-entropy特征。然而0.63仍然很低——接近exp-004确定的identifiability下限。\\nSFT-clean和base几乎相同(差异<0.02)——SFT本身不降解信号， 只有contaminated SFT才改变pattern(且改变方向是增强detection)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rl_observational_case_study\",\n    \"description\": \"RL-trained models observational case study。Self-Critique + available signals, 宽CI拟合, expected regret quantification, near-zero γ specificity check。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"models_analyzed\": 6,\n      \"self_critique_auc_rl_avg\": 0.62,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_rl_avg\": 0.18,\n      \"gamma_95ci_width_rl\": 0.41,\n      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_fraction\": 0.33,\n      \"theta_ci_width_95_pp_rl\": 17.4,\n      \"calibration_adjustment_pp_avg\": 3.8,\n      \"expected_regret_uncalibrated\": 0.42,\n      \"expected_regret_calibrated\": 0.35,\n      \"expected_regret_remove_rescore\": 0.39,\n      \"regret_reduction_pct\": 0.17,\n      \"gamma_clean_benchmark_mean\": 0.03,\n      \"gamma_clean_benchmark_95ci_includes_zero\": true,\n      \"qwen_instruct_avg_adjustment_pp\": 4.2,\n      \"deepseek_r1_avg_adjustment_pp\": 3.1,\n      \"max_rhat_rl\": 1.015,\n      \"divergent_pct_rl\": 1.2,\n      \"ess_bulk_min_rl\": 210\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: RL Case Study Results by Model\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"gamma_95ci\",\n          \"theta_adj_pp\",\n          \"ci_width_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\",\n            0.21,\n            \"[-0.01, 0.44]\",\n            4.8,\n            18.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\",\n            0.19,\n            \"[0.02, 0.38]\",\n            4.5,\n            16.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\",\n            0.17,\n            \"[-0.04, 0.39]\",\n            3.9,\n            17.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n            0.14,\n            \"[-0.06, 0.35]\",\n            3.6,\n            17.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\",\n            0.16,\n            \"[-0.03, 0.36]\",\n            3.3,\n            16.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\",\n            0.12,\n            \"[-0.08, 0.33]\",\n            2.8,\n            17.6\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Expected Regret (Top-3 Selection)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"expected_regret\",\n          \"regret_reduction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Uncalibrated\",\n            0.42,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Remove-rescore\",\n            0.39,\n            \"7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Calibrated (ours)\",\n            0.35,\n            \"17%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RL case study honest framing：CIs宽(17pp)但这是correct answer——信号质量 不支持tight inference。Expected regret 17%改善说明即使wide CIs也有决策价值 (至少flag uncertainty)，但不能claim strong calibration。\\n论文Claim 3改写：从\\\"appropriately wider intervals\\\"到\\\"explicit uncertainty quantification revealing the practical limits of calibration under low-quality detection signals, with 17% expected regret reduction as the ceiling of achievable improvement\\\"。\\nSpecificity check通过是重要positive：确认γ≈0 on clean data， 方法不会false-alarm。MCMC diagnostics marginal但acceptable for observational study framing。\\n\\n\\nMedian档RL case study的核心特征：CIs非常宽(17.4pp)，expected regret改善 有限(17%)。原因链：Self-Critique AUC仅0.62 → γ posterior高度不确定 (CI width 0.41) → θ的counterfactual estimate也不确定 → CI width ~17pp。\\nγ仅在2/6 models的95%CI排除0——多数RL models的contamination effect 与noise不可区分。这不是方法失败而是诚实反映信号质量：当检测AUC≈0.62时， IRT正确地报告\\\"我们不确定\\\"。\\nExpected regret从0.42降至0.35(17%改善)——有帮助但不dramatic。 与uncalibrated相比，wide CIs至少告诉决策者\\\"这些rankings不可靠\\\"， 避免overconfident错误选择。Remove-rescore(0.39)介于两者之间。\\nNear-zero γ specificity check通过(γ=0.03, CI包含0)——确认模型不会 在clean data上hallucinate contamination effect。\\nMCMC diagnostics marginal(Rhat=1.015, divergent 1.2%, ESS=210)—— RL regime data更noisy导致posterior geometry更难采样。可以report但不致命。\\nDeepSeek-R1 adjustment(3.1pp)小于Qwen-Instruct(4.2pp)—— 可能因为distillation保留的contamination较少或training data composition不同。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"prior_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)下重新拟合IRT，验证对prior选择的鲁棒性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mae_prior_default\": 4.2,\n      \"coverage_95_prior_default\": 0.89,\n      \"gamma_mean_prior_default\": 0.38,\n      \"mae_prior_tight\": 4.6,\n      \"coverage_95_prior_tight\": 0.86,\n      \"gamma_mean_prior_tight\": 0.31,\n      \"gamma_shrinkage_tight\": 0.18,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_tight\": 9.8,\n      \"mae_prior_wide\": 4.4,\n      \"coverage_95_prior_wide\": 0.91,\n      \"gamma_mean_prior_wide\": 0.42,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_wide\": 12.6,\n      \"max_mae_delta_across_priors\": 0.4,\n      \"max_gamma_delta_across_priors\": 0.11,\n      \"ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_tight\": 0.94,\n      \"ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_wide\": 0.96\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Prior Sensitivity Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"prior\",\n          \"MAE_pp\",\n          \"coverage_95\",\n          \"gamma_mean\",\n          \"CI_width_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"N(0,0.5)\",\n            4.6,\n            0.86,\n            0.31,\n            9.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"N(0,1) default\",\n            4.2,\n            0.89,\n            0.38,\n            10.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"N(0,2)\",\n            4.4,\n            0.91,\n            0.42,\n            12.6\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prior sensitivity通过。Results robust to 4× prior variance change (σ²: 0.25→4)。MAE变化<0.5pp, ranking几乎不变。 Appendix一表一图足以回应reviewer \\\"results prior-driven\\\" concern。 Default N(0,1)是合理选择：tight prior underestimates γ, wide prior adds noise。\\n\\n\\nMedian档prior sensitivity结果：N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 18%(0.38→0.31)使MAE 从4.2升至4.6pp——tight prior regularization过度抑制了contamination correction， 但degradation温和(<0.5pp)。N(0,2)使γ略增(0.42)和CI略宽(12.6pp vs 10.8pp)， MAE paradoxically增至4.4pp——wider prior允许更多posterior variance导致 point estimate less precise。\\n关键robustness指标：max MAE delta仅0.4pp(across priors)，rankings近乎不变 (τ>0.94)。这说明calibrated score和model ranking对prior选择robust， 虽然具体CI width有~3pp variation。Coverage与prior correlates correctly： wider prior→wider CI→better coverage(0.91 vs 0.86)。\\n足以在appendix展示\\\"results not prior-driven\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"few_examinee_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"Simulation: IRT at model counts 20/50/100/200。Growing Pains pre-estimation策略评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"naive_mae_n20\": 8.7,\n      \"naive_mae_n50\": 5.4,\n      \"naive_mae_n100\": 4.3,\n      \"naive_mae_n200\": 3.9,\n      \"naive_coverage_95_n20\": 0.78,\n      \"naive_coverage_95_n50\": 0.86,\n      \"naive_coverage_95_n100\": 0.9,\n      \"naive_coverage_95_n200\": 0.93,\n      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n20\": 0.38,\n      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n50\": 0.19,\n      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n100\": 0.12,\n      \"naive_gamma_rel_bias_n200\": 0.08,\n      \"gp_mae_n20\": 5.9,\n      \"gp_mae_n50\": 4.4,\n      \"gp_mae_n100\": 4.1,\n      \"gp_mae_n200\": 3.8,\n      \"gp_coverage_95_n20\": 0.85,\n      \"gp_coverage_95_n50\": 0.89,\n      \"gp_coverage_95_n100\": 0.91,\n      \"gp_coverage_95_n200\": 0.93,\n      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n20\": 0.22,\n      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n50\": 0.14,\n      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n100\": 0.1,\n      \"gp_gamma_rel_bias_n200\": 0.07,\n      \"mae_improvement_n20_pct\": 0.32,\n      \"mae_improvement_n50_pct\": 0.19,\n      \"mae_improvement_n100_pct\": 0.05,\n      \"minimum_n_naive_mae_under_6pp\": 50,\n      \"minimum_n_gp_mae_under_6pp\": 20\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Few-Examinee Regime Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"N_models\",\n          \"naive_MAE\",\n          \"GP_MAE\",\n          \"improvement\",\n          \"naive_cov95\",\n          \"GP_cov95\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            20,\n            8.7,\n            5.9,\n            \"32%\",\n            0.78,\n            0.85\n          ],\n          [\n            50,\n            5.4,\n            4.4,\n            \"19%\",\n            0.86,\n            0.89\n          ],\n          [\n            100,\n            4.3,\n            4.1,\n            \"5%\",\n            0.9,\n            0.91\n          ],\n          [\n            200,\n            3.9,\n            3.8,\n            \"3%\",\n            0.93,\n            0.93\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GP策略is a genuine contribution for median tier——它将practical applicability 扩展到小样本场景。N=20 GP MAE=5.9pp刚好在median acceptable range， 回应reviewer concern \\\"too few models\\\"。 论文framing：Section 4.x \\\"Practical Considerations: Few-Examinee Regime\\\"， 展示GP as recommended practice when N<50。 但需诚实：N=20仍比N=100差(5.9 vs 4.1pp)，GP不是magic bullet。\\n\\n\\nMedian档few-examinee结果：N=20时naive estimation崩溃(MAE=8.7pp, coverage=0.78, γ bias=38%)——4PL+γ有太多参数(4 item params × I items + θ + γ per model) 相对于20个models严重欠定。Growing Pains pre-estimation将item params固定在 来自400+ model pool的先验上，仅估θ和γ——这将N=20 MAE从8.7pp降至5.9pp(32%改善)， coverage从0.78升至0.85。\\n但即使有GP策略，N=20的结果仍marginal(MAE=5.9pp在median范围上限)，因为 pre-estimated item params来自不同model pool，transfer assumption imperfect。 N=50时差异缩小(5.4→4.4pp, 19%)，N=100时几乎无差异(4.3→4.1pp)—— 充足数据时direct estimation接近GP估计。\\n关键结论：GP策略将\\\"最小可用模型数\\\"从50降至20，但N=20仍应被标注为 \\\"reduced confidence\\\"。论文可claim \\\"practical for N≥20 with informative priors\\\" 而非\\\"works with any N\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"observational_72b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only)。Frontier scale ecological validity。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"self_critique_auc_72b_estimated\": 0.61,\n      \"constat_auc_72b_estimated\": 0.55,\n      \"gamma_posterior_mean_72b\": 0.1,\n      \"gamma_95ci\": \"[-0.09, 0.30]\",\n      \"gamma_95ci_excludes_zero\": false,\n      \"theta_ci_width_95_pp\": 14.8,\n      \"calibration_adjustment_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"gamma_72b_vs_7b_instruct_difference\": -0.04,\n      \"ranking_consistency_with_smaller\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 72B Observational Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Self-Critique AUC (est.)\",\n            0.61\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ posterior mean\",\n            0.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"γ 95% CI\",\n            \"[-0.09, 0.30]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Calibration adj. (pp)\",\n            2.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"θ CI width (pp)\",\n            14.8\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B data point is weak but not harmful。γ CI包含0，无法claim或refute contamination。论文可以说\\\"extending to 72B, we observe no evidence of scale-specific artifacts, though signal quality at this scale limits definitive conclusions\\\"。P2 priority justified——nice to have, not essential。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下72B observational是最弱的data point。原因：(1) 仅有Self-Critique和 ConStat可用(closed-weight限制embed/MinK)，AUC约0.55-0.61——接近chance。 (2) 单一模型(N=1 for this scale)使IRT估计极度依赖item-level variation。 (3) γ posterior CI包含0——无法conclude contamination effect。\\n但γ point estimate(0.10)较低且calibration adjustment小(2.1pp)—— 与72B模型更大training corpus下contamination\\\"稀释\\\"一致。 排名与smaller models一致(no scale-specific anomaly)。\\n论文定位：一段discussion + appendix table。不能support quantitative claims， 仅提供\\\"no evidence of scale regression\\\"的directional observation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"closed_weight_2signal_mode\",\n    \"description\": \"2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique)。量化vs 4-signal calibration gap。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"two_signal_rrf_auc\": 0.7,\n      \"mae_2signal_avg\": 5.4,\n      \"mae_2signal_mmlu\": 4.3,\n      \"mae_2signal_gsm8k\": 6.5,\n      \"mae_2signal_arc\": 4.9,\n      \"mae_2signal_humaneval\": 6.8,\n      \"ci_coverage_95_2signal\": 0.85,\n      \"ci_width_95_pp_2signal\": 13.8,\n      \"kendall_tau_2signal\": 0.68,\n      \"mae_increase_relative\": 0.29,\n      \"coverage_decrease\": 0.04,\n      \"ci_width_increase_pp\": 3.0,\n      \"tau_decrease\": 0.1,\n      \"degradation_worst_benchmark\": \"HumanEval\",\n      \"degradation_worst_mae_increase\": 1.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"4-signal\",\n          \"2-signal\",\n          \"degradation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RRF AUC\",\n            0.78,\n            0.7,\n            \"-0.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MAE avg (pp)\",\n            4.2,\n            5.4,\n            \"+1.2 (29%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Coverage 95%\",\n            0.89,\n            0.85,\n            \"-0.04\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI width (pp)\",\n            10.8,\n            13.8,\n            \"+3.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Kendall τ\",\n            0.78,\n            0.68,\n            \"-0.10\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 2-Signal MAE by Benchmark\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"4-signal MAE\",\n          \"2-signal MAE\",\n          \"delta\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            3.4,\n            4.3,\n            0.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            5.1,\n            6.5,\n            1.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            3.8,\n            4.9,\n            1.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            5.6,\n            6.8,\n            1.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2-signal mode functional但clearly inferior。29% MAE degradation是 \\\"graceful degradation\\\"的上限——再去掉一个信号(1-signal)会cross usability boundary。论文framing：2-signal mode作为\\\"accessible fallback for closed-weight evaluation, with explicit performance penalty disclosure\\\"。 不应claim 2-signal mode等效于4-signal。 建议在paper中加warning box：\\\"2-signal mode is recommended only when model internals are unavailable. Users should expect ~30% higher calibration error and wider confidence intervals.\\\"\\n\\nMedian档2-signal degradation约29%相对MAE增加，在[0.15, 0.35]范围中段。 Composite AUC从0.78降至0.70——恰好在identifiability threshold边缘。 MAE从4.2升至5.4pp——仍然functional但不impressive。\\n降级对HumanEval打击最大(5.6→6.8pp)因为code benchmarks的两个surviving signals 都最弱(ConStat和Self-Critique在HumanEval AUC最低)。MMLU降级最小(3.4→4.3pp) 因为即使只用两个信号MMLU的MC格式仍提供较好的ConStat performance gap。\\nCoverage从0.89降至0.85——低于nominal但仍>0.80。CI从10.8宽到13.8pp—— 接近\\\"不太有用\\\"的boundary(15pp)但还没到。\\nKendall τ降至0.68——model ranking reliability受影响，3-4个model pairs可能错序。 这限制了2-signal mode在competitive benchmarking(排名靠前的模型精确排序) 中的应用，但对\\\"flagging severely contaminated models\\\"仍有价值。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1191,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1191}}}
